The '''Magic 8 Ball''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessories|Accessory]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Magic 8 Ball''' can be obtained from rounds 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]] with starting bid of {{c|20000000}}.

'''Magic 8 Ball''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
The '''Magic 8 Ball''' randomly grants various buffs depending on the current SkyBlock season.
